{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Race Simulator puts your feet on the pedal and your heart in overdrive\u2014blaze through tight turns, push past rivals, and feel every second count in a rush of speed, skill, and pure racing adrenaline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934110/extras/89a872c6f732bfcd6d0815d1a482ad9e.poster.avif?t=1772546644\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934110/extras/89a872c6f732bfcd6d0815d1a482ad9e.webm?t=1772546644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934110/extras/89a872c6f732bfcd6d0815d1a482ad9e.mp4?t=1772546644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Car Race Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car Race Simulator features one high-performance car, the GT86, and delivers intense gameplay through 6 unique events, 6 tough challenges, and 5 thrilling championships. Each mode is designed to test your speed, control, and racing precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934110/extras/44fd354327aeb46e3c185a0d3dd37818.poster.avif?t=1772546644\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934110/extras/44fd354327aeb46e3c185a0d3dd37818.webm?t=1772546644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934110/extras/44fd354327aeb46e3c185a0d3dd37818.mp4?t=1772546644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><